  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stars of Change (Nugum El Taghyiir) - Promoting and Protecting Women&apos;s Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective of the action is &apos;&apos;To empower women victims of trafficking, youth and feminists in order to promote women&#xBF;s rights&apos;&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objective of this action is &quot;To empower women victims of trafficking and their families to reclaim their violated rights and improve their psychological, medical, economical, legal and social status in El Azizia and Tamoh communities in Giza&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
